{
  "id": 8867218292935,
  "title": "Softball Lover Teal Yellow Bedding – Stylish Sports Theme Comforter",
  "handle": "softball-lover-teal-yellow-bedding-stylish-sports-theme-comforter",
  "body_html": "<p>Embrace your love for softball with this stylish and comfortable comforter set from Jeminise. Designed for softball players, fans, and lovers, this bedding set brings a vibrant sports theme to any bedroom, offering a soft and smooth feel for a relaxing atmosphere.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Softball Theme:</strong> Show your team spirit with a bedding set dedicated to softball players, fans, and lovers.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Choose from Twin, Full, Queen, and King sizes to fit your bed perfectly.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Premium Material:</strong> Crafted from 100% brushed microfiber polyester (360 gsm) for an ultra-soft, smooth, durable, and fade-resistant feel.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Cool &amp; Breathable:</strong> Microfiber material provides a cool and breathable sleeping experience, more durable than traditional cotton.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Vibrant Design:</strong> Unique pattern design with bright colors adds a relaxing and wonderful mood to your bedroom decor.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Included Components:</strong> This set includes a comfortable comforter, making it a complete bedding solution.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable and dries quickly; tumble dry low for convenient maintenance.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Comforter Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>70% Cotton, 30% Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>Softball Design 05</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>Comforter</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Twin 68\"x90\"(173cm*218cm), Full 79\"x90\"(200cm*230cm), Queen 90x90\"(228cm*228cm), King 104\"x90\"(228cm*264cm)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Sport</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>Fall, Spring, Summer</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Thread Count</th>\n<td>360</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Recommended Uses for Product</th>\n<td>Napping, Reading, Travel</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Number of Pieces</th>\n<td>3</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
